{"title":"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>Kati has the following collection of umbrellas.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>(image needed: plain umbrella, dotted umbrella, plain umbrella, dotted umbrella, plain umbrella)\n</p><p>If the plain umbrellas cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/f/1af88c1534bab510152766fb60851db0c3a5af52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> and the spotted umbrellas cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/8/1382a05b7a5de75e75c7c4ce1139716e2a729d22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" />, what is the total cost of the umbrellas in dollars?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the picture, we can see that Kati has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> umbrellas that are plain and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> umbrellas that are dotted.\n</p><p>Because each plain umbrella costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/f/1af88c1534bab510152766fb60851db0c3a5af52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> plain umbrellas cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/a/7ea736cb1e3182acafdaa408b5316161cde06efe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$10 \\times 3 = \\$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"17\" /> in total.\n</p><p>Because each dotted umbrella costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/8/1382a05b7a5de75e75c7c4ce1139716e2a729d22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" />, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> plain umbrellas cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/d/2ad22c675b810bcb74b08dc65c20981b8709b155.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"37\" height=\"16\" /> in total. \n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 2\">player 2</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/5/3c5836d0859a65de65ca0d9177647f79635b7dd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> plain umbrellas cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/d/96d89f2d12c9f51355cb705365311f1647635933.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2 \\times 20 = \\$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"17\" /> in total.\n</p><p>In total, the umbrellas cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/a/9fa8f83e150e5e0f4adfe77be4102cd3a587f5ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$40 + \\$30 = \\boxed{\\$70}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"141\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC\">2024 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 2\">Practice Relay Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align